<p>Spin around, extending your weapon in radius 2 and damaging all targets around you for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">171%, 184%, 194%, 202%, 210%</acronym> weapon damage.</p><p>At level 3 all damage done will also make the targets bleed for an additional <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">30%, 53%, 71%, 86%, 100%</acronym> damage over 5 turns</p>